Error [jet.ReadOnlyValueNotOwned]: `value` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> Tests/UI/Taint/scrub_removes_only_its_named_tag.jet:5:56
    |
  5 | #Scrub(PII) redact: fn(value: #PII String) -> String { value }
    |                                                        ^^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return value.copy()` — or take ownership: `value: &&#PII String`. To return borrowed data, declare `-> View<T> from value` and return a view derived from `value`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120

Error [jet.TaggedValueDenied]: A `Input` value is denied at `process.cmd`
  --> Tests/UI/Taint/scrub_removes_only_its_named_tag.jet:9:16
    |
  9 |     _: process.cmd(["echo", value])
    |                ^^^
 Why: The declaration for `Input` denies `Exec`, which covers this destination
 Fix: Remove the destination use, or pass the value through a matching `#Scrub(Input)` function
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0721
